1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:08,634
Part 5 mein product aur medicine catalogue dekhenge: naya product jodna, PTR, PTS aur MRP,

2
00:00:08,634 --> 00:00:16,272
HSN aur GST, schedule, barcode, reorder level, edit karna aur product band karna.

3
00:00:17,217 --> 00:00:20,156
Masters mein Products kholiye.

4
00:00:20,156 --> 00:00:28,680
Yahan har product ki wholesale rates dikhti hain: PTR, PTS, MRP, GST, pack aur company.

5
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:34,853
Stock yahan nahi, balki Stock screen par batch-wise dikhta hai.

6
00:00:35,523 --> 00:00:40,986
Search box mein brand naam ya salt likh kar product dhoondh sakte hain.

7
00:00:40,986 --> 00:00:46,295
Jaise Paracetamol likhne par Febrinil ke dono strength aa jaate hain.

8
00:00:46,295 --> 00:00:51,143
Company filter se ek company ke saare products dekh sakte hain.

9
00:00:51,798 --> 00:00:54,644
Ab naya product jodte hain.

10
00:00:54,644 --> 00:00:56,752
Add product kholiye.

11
00:00:56,752 --> 00:01:00,125
Product name: Levocet Kid Syrup.

12
00:01:00,125 --> 00:01:04,552
Generic yaani composition: Levocetirizine.

13
00:01:04,552 --> 00:01:09,506
Strength aur form, yahan syrup, aur pack 60 ml.

14
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:15,191
Company chuniye: Nirmal Demo Formulations.

15
00:01:15,191 --> 00:01:19,744
HSN code 30049099, aur GST 12 percent.

16
00:01:19,744 --> 00:01:27,771
HSN aur GST sahi hone se hi invoice aur GST return sahi bante hain.

17
00:01:28,441 --> 00:01:29,365
Ab rates.

18
00:01:29,365 --> 00:01:33,777
MRP GST ke saath hota hai, yahan 85 rupaye.

19
00:01:33,777 --> 00:01:41,575
PTR, yani price to retailer, GST ke bina, jis par chemist ko maal milta hai.

20
00:01:41,575 --> 00:01:48,861
PTS, price to stockist, aur bhi kam hota hai, sub-distributors ke liye.

21
00:01:49,521 --> 00:01:53,664
Dekhiye, maine PTR galti se 80 rupaye daala.

22
00:01:53,664 --> 00:02:02,421
Add product dabane par Medoro rok deta hai: PTR plus GST MRP se upar hai, rates check kariye.

23
00:02:02,421 --> 00:02:06,941
Aisi galti se chemist ka margin khatam ho jaata.

24
00:02:07,605 --> 00:02:11,638
PTR theek karke 59 rupaye 50 paise karte hain.

25
00:02:11,638 --> 00:02:18,213
Barcode, ek pack mein kitni units, ek case mein kitne packs, minimum order,

26
00:02:18,213 --> 00:02:20,843
aur reorder level bhi bhariye.

27
00:02:20,843 --> 00:02:25,577
Reorder level se neeche stock jaate hi alert aata hai.

28
00:02:26,235 --> 00:02:30,800
Schedule H ya H1 dawaiyon ke liye schedule chuniye.

29
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:37,872
Show on chemist portal tick ho, toh yeh product chemists ke portal par dikhega.

30
00:02:37,872 --> 00:02:39,215
Ab Add product.

31
00:02:39,877 --> 00:02:42,091
Product list mein aa gaya.

32
00:02:42,091 --> 00:02:49,157
Ab kisi product ko edit karna ho, jaise rate badalna, toh uske saamne Edit dabaiye.

33
00:02:49,157 --> 00:02:53,073
Yahan reorder level badal kar save karte hain.

34
00:02:53,719 --> 00:03:01,275
Product ko delete nahi kiya jaata, kyunki uske purane invoices aur stock record rehne chahiye.

35
00:03:01,275 --> 00:03:06,741
Agar company ne product band kar diya, toh Discontinued tick kariye.

36
00:03:06,741 --> 00:03:11,403
Woh naye orders mein nahi aayega, par history safe rahegi.

37
00:03:12,057 --> 00:03:19,171
Yaad rakhiye: PTR plus GST hamesha MRP se kam ho, PTS PTR se upar na ho,

38
00:03:19,171 --> 00:03:23,716
aur HSN aur GST company ke invoice se milaiye.

39
00:03:23,716 --> 00:03:27,965
Sahi catalogue hi sahi billing ki neev hai.

40
00:03:29,646 --> 00:03:34,934
Part 6 mein godown aur inventory management: naya godown, racks,

41
00:03:34,934 --> 00:03:42,369
product ko rack par rakhna, batch-wise stock, stock value, audited adjustment, quarantine,

42
00:03:42,369 --> 00:03:45,674
low stock aur godowns ke beech transfer.

43
00:03:46,619 --> 00:03:50,137
Masters mein Godowns and racks kholiye.

44
00:03:50,137 --> 00:03:56,360
Hamare paas do godown hain: Medoro Main Godown aur Kanke Road Godown.

45
00:03:56,360 --> 00:04:04,207
Har godown ka code, GSTIN, licence, racks ki ginti aur cost par stock value dikhti hai.

46
00:04:04,885 --> 00:04:07,061
Naya godown jodte hain.

47
00:04:07,061 --> 00:04:08,859
Add godown kholiye.

48
00:04:08,859 --> 00:04:12,927
Naam: Dhanbad Depot, code DHN, aur address.

49
00:04:12,927 --> 00:04:21,537
Professional plan mein teen godown tak, aur Enterprise mein bees tak godown mil sakte hain.

50
00:04:22,193 --> 00:04:22,998
Ab racks.

51
00:04:22,998 --> 00:04:27,205
Har rack ka code, zone aur pick order hota hai.

52
00:04:27,205 --> 00:04:34,723
Pick list isi order mein chalti hai, taaki picker ko baar-baar peeche na jaana pade.

53
00:04:34,723 --> 00:04:38,392
Cold chain wale rack alag mark hote hain.

54
00:04:38,392 --> 00:04:41,077
Ek naya rack A-07 banate hain.

55
00:04:41,743 --> 00:04:48,209
Product ko rack par rakhne ke liye product aur rack chuniye aur Place dabaiye.

56
00:04:48,209 --> 00:04:51,774
Naya Levocet syrup rack A-07 par rakh diya.

57
00:04:51,774 --> 00:04:56,499
Ab picking ke samay picker ko seedha rack number dikhega.

58
00:05:06,340 --> 00:05:09,408
Ab Stock and transfers kholiye.

59
00:05:09,408 --> 00:05:17,722
Yahan har batch ki line hai: product, batch number, expiry, rack, packs, quarantine,

60
00:05:17,722 --> 00:05:19,009
cost aur MRP.

61
00:05:19,009 --> 00:05:22,176
Upar kul stock value dikhti hai.

62
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:30,564
Stock sirf GRN, invoice, return, claim, transfer ya audited adjustment se hi badalta hai.

63
00:05:30,564 --> 00:05:33,866
Koi seedha number edit nahi kar sakta.

64
00:05:33,866 --> 00:05:41,426
Search mein Febrinil likhiye: iske alag-alag batches, alag expiry ke saath dikhte hain.

65
00:05:42,079 --> 00:05:48,971
Agar ginti mein fark mile, jaise ek strip toot gayi, toh Stock adjustment use kariye.

66
00:05:48,971 --> 00:05:54,160
Batch chuniye, minus 2 units likhiye, aur reason zaroor daaliye.

67
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:59,835
Yeh adjustment audit trail mein naam aur samay ke saath darj hota hai.

68
00:06:00,492 --> 00:06:07,622
Quarantine ka matlab hai woh maal jo bika nahi ja sakta: chemist ka lautaya hua expired ya

69
00:06:07,622 --> 00:06:08,494
toota maal.

70
00:06:08,494 --> 00:06:14,753
Yeh stock alag column mein rehta hai aur supplier claim ke liye ruka rehta hai.

71
00:06:14,753 --> 00:06:18,080
Hum ise Part 14 mein detail mein dekhenge.

72
00:06:18,736 --> 00:06:24,529
Low stock pehchanne ke liye dashboard par Products below reorder level ka link hai,

73
00:06:24,529 --> 00:06:30,461
aur Business intelligence mein automatic reorder suggestions hain, jo bikri ki speed,

74
00:06:30,461 --> 00:06:34,020
lead time aur safety stock se quantity batate hain.

75
00:06:34,667 --> 00:06:36,513
Ab godown transfer.

76
00:06:36,513 --> 00:06:40,399
Stock tab par Request transfer form hai.

77
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:46,130
Batch chuniye, kis godown mein bhejna hai, aur kitne units.

78
00:06:46,130 --> 00:06:48,559
Request transfer dabaiye.

79
00:06:49,214 --> 00:06:56,885
Transfer teen kadam mein hota hai: request, approve aur bhejna, phir doosre godown mein receive.

80
00:06:56,885 --> 00:07:03,758
Jab tak maal raaste mein hai, woh kisi bhi godown ke bikne wale stock mein nahi ginta.

81
00:07:03,758 --> 00:07:07,114
Is tarah stock kabhi do jagah nahi dikhta.

82
00:07:07,763 --> 00:07:12,967
Yaad rakhiye: har mahine physical count karke adjustment kariye,

83
00:07:12,967 --> 00:07:18,822
expiry ke paas wala maal pehle nikaliye, aur reorder level sahi rakhiye.

84
00:07:18,822 --> 00:07:23,863
Isse shortage bhi nahi hogi aur expiry ka nuksan bhi kam hoga.

85
00:07:25,446 --> 00:07:32,104
Part 9 mein batch-wise inventory, expiry tracking aur stock reservation samjhenge: order

86
00:07:32,104 --> 00:07:36,039
approve hote hi kaunsa batch kaise reserve hota hai,

87
00:07:36,039 --> 00:07:39,746
aur near-expiry aur expired maal ka kya hota hai.

88
00:07:40,707 --> 00:07:45,946
Pharma mein har strip ka batch number aur expiry hota hai.

89
00:07:45,946 --> 00:07:49,559
Stock screen par Montiluk LC dhoondhiye.

90
00:07:49,559 --> 00:07:57,599
Iske do ya zyada batches hain, har ek ka apna batch number, expiry, rack, packs aur cost.

91
00:07:58,272 --> 00:08:01,429
Packs column godown mein pada kul maal hai.

92
00:08:01,429 --> 00:08:05,908
Iska kuch hissa approved orders ke liye reserve ho sakta hai.

93
00:08:05,908 --> 00:08:09,652
Reserved packs order ki pick list mein dikhte hain,

94
00:08:09,652 --> 00:08:16,700
aur naya order banate samay Stock column reservation ghata kar hi bikne laayak stock batata hai.

95
00:08:17,362 --> 00:08:21,057
Ab ek pending order approve karke dekhte hain.

96
00:08:21,057 --> 00:08:24,671
Orders mein New Sai Medicos ka order kholiye.

97
00:08:24,671 --> 00:08:32,382
Abhi status Awaiting approval hai, aur value aur credit card par likha hai: Within credit terms.

98
00:08:33,033 --> 00:08:38,445
Approve dabate hi Medoro do kaam karta hai: credit dobara check karta hai,

99
00:08:38,445 --> 00:08:44,662
aur har product ke liye FEFO yaani first expiry first out ke hisaab se batch chun kar

100
00:08:44,662 --> 00:08:46,637
packs reserve kar deta hai.

101
00:08:47,304 --> 00:08:49,665
Neeche pick list ban gayi.

102
00:08:49,665 --> 00:08:55,748
Har line mein rack, product, batch, expiry aur reserved packs hain.

103
00:08:55,748 --> 00:09:03,284
Sabse pehle expire hone wala batch pehle chuna gaya, taaki purana maal pehle nikle.

104
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:09,131
Agar kisi batch ki expiry chemist ki minimum shelf life se kam hai,

105
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:16,415
jo settings mein 90 din jaisa rakha jaata hai, toh woh batch chemist ko allocate hi nahi hota.

106
00:09:16,415 --> 00:09:19,824
Short-dated maal chemist tak nahi pahunchta.

107
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:23,004
Ab Expiry and claims kholiye.

108
00:09:23,004 --> 00:09:28,552
Upar chaar aankde: expired ya 30 din mein expire hone wala maal,

109
00:09:28,552 --> 00:09:36,614
abhi claim ho sakne wala maal aur uska expected credit, khule claims, aur ab tak mila credit.

110
00:09:37,263 --> 00:09:45,851
Expiry workbench mein har batch ka band dikhta hai: Expired, 30 din, 31 se 60 din, 61 se 90 din.

111
00:09:45,851 --> 00:09:51,308
Saath mein shelf par kitna hai, quarantine mein kitna, value,

112
00:09:51,308 --> 00:09:55,691
aur kya woh company ki claim window ke andar hai.

113
00:09:56,347 --> 00:10:02,406
Jaise Gastrocalm Gel ka ek batch 15 November ko expire ho chuka hai.

114
00:10:02,406 --> 00:10:07,484
Eligible likha hai, 70 percent credit ki ummeed ke saath.

115
00:10:07,484 --> 00:10:13,454
Expired maal bikta nahi, isliye ise claim karna hi sahi raasta hai.

116
00:10:13,454 --> 00:10:17,463
Claim ka poora process Part 14 mein dekhenge.

117
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:25,114
Stock reconciliation ke liye har batch ki har movement record hoti hai: GRN se aaya,

118
00:10:25,114 --> 00:10:32,348
invoice se gaya, return se wapas, claim se company ko, transfer, ya audited adjustment.

119
00:10:32,348 --> 00:10:37,254
Isliye batch ka balance hamesha movements se mil jaata hai.

120
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:43,961
Yaad rakhiye: FEFO par bharosa rakhiye, near-expiry list har hafte dekhiye,

121
00:10:43,961 --> 00:10:47,914
aur claim window band hone se pehle claim kariye.
